  "conclusion": "After correcting only the loop orientation and including every boundary piece geometrically inside the predeclared spanning surface, the Faraday prediction reproduces V+\u2212V\u2212 with relative complex disagreement from 8.23e-7 to 1.14e-5 across both modes and both records. Thus the 5\u20137 mV mirror-surface difference is the magnetic-flux/path term of the stored discrete EM solution to the precision of the exported data and post-processing. This does not choose a readout path, establish continuum convergence, validate the three-mode reduction, or authorize a coupling extraction."
